WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.840
<i>The absolutely beautiful and sweet young 
Russian girl I serve, Misha-sama,</i>

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.690
<i>doesn't have any friends.</i>

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.690
<i>It's summer break,</i>

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.940
<i>and all she's doing is playing 
games at home by herself.</i>

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:16.800
<i>I, Kamoi Tsubame, twenty-eight years 
of age, do not believe this is right.</i>

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.670
<i>I was in the Japan Air Self-Defense 
Force up until three months ago,</i>

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.960
<i>and three days ago, I started as 
a maid here at Misha-sama's house.</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:29.090
<i>I've tried various methods to 
become Misha-sama's friend, but...</i>

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.350
Go away!

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.010
<b>Failed</b>

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.310
<i>They've all failed.</i>

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.670
<i>But I will not give up.</i>

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.820
<i>I will become her friend!</i>

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.490
<b>Episode 2:  My Maid Kidnapped Me</b>

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:15.970
293... 294...

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:18.230
What can I do...

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:19.810
295...

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:20.740
...to become her friend...

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.680
296...

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:23.480
Friends...

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:25.160
297...

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:26.230
Friends...

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:27.760
298...

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:28.680
Friends...

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:32.000
299... 300...

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:37.670
The game she's playing...

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.760
<b>Cooperative Mode with a Friend!</b>

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.240
This is it!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.440
They have a friend system.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:42.980
I can use this...

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.040
<i>First, I become friends with her in the 
game without her knowing who I am...</i>

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.910
I made a friend online.

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.380
I have a lot of fun everyday.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.820
I want to meet her someday.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:02.770
Milady, that friend is actually me!

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.480
It was you!

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:07.200
<i>And then I tell her who
I really am when we get close!</i>

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:11.420
I never knew I had such a 
great friend so close to me.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.710
Now we can "cooperate" 24 hours a day.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.370
That's good! This can work!

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.640
I forgot to breathe while working out!

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:25.220
<i>I don't think I'll be able 
to show my legs this summer.</i>

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:32.440
But Milady will wear cute clothes 
for me... or at least I hope so.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.940
Let's make a character first.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:41.150
<b>Kinue</b>

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:41.150
<b>Deceased grandmother's name</b>

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.150
I've made the perfect little girl!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.990
<b>Would you like to start a game
 with this character?</b>

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.990
Let's start.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:47.740
First, I need to become 
friends with Milady.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.120
<b>Would you like to use
 the friend-finding BBS?</b>

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.120
<b>Yes                     No</b>

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.820
The Internet is like an ocean,

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:56.630
and I need to write a post that would 
only fish out Milady for me...

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:01.800
I guess if worse comes to worst,
I can just secretly find out her ID.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.880
<b>Warning: This is a crime.</b>

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.640
In any event, let's try it.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:09.000
"I'm a girl in second grade that lives 
in Yotaka City. My name's Kinue."

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.610
"I'm looking for girls my age to be friends."

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.440
"It'd be nice if you lived close to me."

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:19.530
"I like ferrets, so someone with lots 
of ferret pictures would be fun."

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.350
"I'm new to the game, so 
please teach me how to play."

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.780
<b>Would you like to 
post this message?</b>

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.780
<b>No</b>

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.480
I think that was perfect.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:31.220
There can't be that many girls in second 
grade that live in Yotaka City and have a ferret!

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.540
Already got a message!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.040
<b>You have received
65 friend requests.</b>

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:37.790
Huh?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.630
<b>Are you really in second grade?
 I'll give you lots of rare items, so lets talk on Lime.</b>

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.990
"Are you really in second grade?"

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:43.590
<b>You're in second grade, so 7 or 8, right?
I live in Yotaka City, too.
Let's meet up and talk!
I'll teach you anything you want.</b>

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:42.920
"You're in second grade, so 7 or 8, right?"

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.350
"I live in Yotaka City, too."

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.550
"I don't have a ferret, 
but I wouldn't mind—"

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.550
<b>I don't have a ferret, 
but I wouldn't mind showing you
 the ferret between my legs.</b>

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:48.970
A pedophile!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.970
<b>Report</b>

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.970
<b>Destroy</b>

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.470
Destroy them!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.970
Destroy them!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.100
The world is frightening.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.820
I need to protect Milady!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.360
<b>You have received 1 new friend request.</b>

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:05.700
It's probably another pedophile.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:09.370
<b>From: Kumagoro</b>

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:09.370
<b>Are you really in second grade?
You're not just pretending to be a girl, right?
I live in Yotaka City and I have a ferret.</b>

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.370
Kumagoro?

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.340
That's Milady's ferret!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.620
But it could be some big old 
dude named Kumagoro, too...

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.300
It's Milady!

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:26.820
It's fate for us to meet in this vast sea!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.140
I'm not pretending to be a girl.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.970
Let's be friends.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:40.080
It's cute how ferrets wiggle around.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.840
Send.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.320
<b>You've become friends with Kumagoro-san!</b>

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.990
Milady and I are friends!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.060
Now we...

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:56.740
It looks good on you.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.190
Open up.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.300
I love you.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:04.160
We could be friends like that!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.800
<b>I'll help you with missions,
so let me know whenever.</b>

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.840
Milady is so nice...

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.680
Let's play then!

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:20.040
I think this is where I'm supposed to meet.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.150
Kinue-chan?

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:23.610
Yeah!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.250
It's Kumagoro.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.490
<b>Kumagoro</b>

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.490
N-Nice to meet you.

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.780
You spent a lot of money
on that outfit didn't you?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.290
The clothes were cute,
so I used my severance...

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.080
I mean New Year's money.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:45.270
I did that at first, too,

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.910
but all these weird people kept messaging me.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.590
I changed my profile to say 
I'm a 42 year old housewife.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.470
You should be careful, too.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:57.720
<i>If she likes cute clothes,</i>

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:01.230
<i>then she'll like all 
those frilly clothes, too!</i>

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.230
The clothes you made are cute!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.110
<i>That might just happen!</i>

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.860
What weapons do you have?

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.000
This.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.740
That's the default gun.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.550
I ran out of money after 
buying the clothes...

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:16.490
Right.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:17.780
Well, that's fine.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.420
You can clear the initial 
areas with the basic gun.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.220
Okay!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.260
<i>Milady is so nice!</i>

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.590
<b>Let's clean up the city!</b>

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.650
Clean up?

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.680
What do you do with the gun?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.340
You're got a nice rack.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:35.560
Get away.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.060
You're leaving?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.840
Shoot him.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:44.020
He's a person! A normal citizen!

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.060
That's the type of game this is.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.240
Huh?

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.320
<i>I didn't know the game would be like this...</i>

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.960
Hurry up.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.200
R-Right.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.150
I'm sorry, old man!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.130
He's been purified!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.510
Good morning. It feels nice out today.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.260
<b>The city has been cleaned up!</b>

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.640
What's up with this game?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.060
You're good.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:16.760
Yes.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:18.890
I practiced with the 9mm...

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.100
Huh?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:23.020
I practiced a lot before I came here.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.190
Let's do the next mission.

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:29.110
Okay!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.280
Thank you for today.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:37.160
Feel free to ask for me again.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.560
Sure. Bye.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:51.540
That's it!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.430
That's good.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.510
Looks like you're having fun.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.640
I told you not to come in without asking.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:06.810
You're taking pictures?

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:12.480
Yes, I made a friend that likes ferrets.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:17.320
A friend that likes me for more than
just my appearance, unlike you.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.310
Kumagoro, try sticking your 
head out from the blankets.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:27.290
You're so smart!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.800
Kinue-chan is going to be happy.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.050
<b>Milady, I'm Kinue.</b>

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.100
<i>I want to say something!</i>

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:41.310
<i>I want to tell her I was watching 
her taking pictures for me.</i>

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:46.270
<i>But I'm going to have fun keeping 
this secret a bit longer.</i>

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.620
I'll be leaving you for today.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.320
She goes home right after 
she finishes lately.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.320
She isn't trying to do anything with me.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:05.470
I guess it doesn't matter. I need 
to send Kinue-chan pictures.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:11.100
<i>I wonder if Kinue-chan 
is going to log in soon.</i>

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.570
<i>I want to show her pictures of Kumagoro.</i>

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:14.960
<b>An owner won't pick up
his dog's droppings.
Grant retribution
from the heavens!</b>

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.840
<b>An owner won't pick up
his dog's droppings.
Grant retribution
from the heavens!</b>

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.500
A guerrilla mission!

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.770
It's a raid boss!

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.270
I can't take care of this on my own!

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:42.620
I'm here!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:43.870
Kinue-chan!

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:48.750
It was cute, so I bought it.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.920
Th-That's expensive.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.050
Let's do this together!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:10:59.170
Yeah!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:04.550
Love Shine Attack!

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.400
There we go.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:14.810
We did it.

00:11:14.810 --> 00:11:17.360
Yes, we did, Milady!

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:22.360
<i>I got so excited, I...</i>

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.180
I...

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.370
I knew something was strange.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.040
The way you use your emoticons felt like you're 
trying to be younger than you actually are...

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.130
T-Trying to be younger?!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.210
Liar! Idiot! Lolicon!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.210
Milady! Milady!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:42.400
Milady!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.970
<b>Kumagoro-san has logged out.</b>

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.540
Milady...

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.240
<i>It's warm...</i>

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.990
<i>It's not like being tucked in...</i>

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:06.710
<i>This is...</i>

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:08.700
<i>But...</i>

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.040
<i>I'm shaking a lot.</i>

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:15.130
Huh?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:16.550
What?!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:24.090
So I was thinking of camping out here today.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.640
What?!

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.420
What are you talking about?

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.340
Actually, I was sleeping in my bed...

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.160
Where am I?

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:33.930
A mountain?

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:34.850
Yes, that's right.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:38.360
I carried you while you were 
sleeping all the way here.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.150
Wh-Why?

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.610
Well...

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:48.080
You wouldn't listen to anything I had 
to say after what happened in that MMO.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.240
I wanted to make up...

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:54.920
Did you think I'd be all 
happy and make up with you?

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.130
"Yay! We get to go camping together"?

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:00.810
You know, there's Stockholm 
syndrome and everything.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:02.880
Stockholm syndrome?

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:07.720
Stockholm syndrome is when someone 
that has been kidnapped or confined

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.570
spends a lot of time

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:13.090
with the perpetrator, leading
to excess feelings of sympathy or love.

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:14.570
That's a serious crime!

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:16.310
You kidnapped me!

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:19.060
I, Takanashi Yasuhiro, give Kamoi Tsubame (our maid)
 permission to take my daughter, Misha camping.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:19.060
No, I got your father's permission.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.570
Yasuhiro, you idiot!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.440
Also, why am I dressed like this?

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:27.450
Well, the mountains get 
cold, even in the summer.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.580
But I thought it would 
be a bit early for me to

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.500
take off your pajamas 
while you were sleeping.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.580
I don't think that should 
happen early or late.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:38.960
I'm wearing normal clothes underneath.

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:44.140
I brought you on my back all 
the way here in daylight.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:46.590
Everyone said you were cute.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:50.950
They said we looked like mother and child.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:54.500
You're...

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:57.440
You're not my mom!

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:00.940
Of course not.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:06.320
You've got that platinum 
hair, and those green eyes.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.530
That white skin...

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:11.160
A miracle that is a pure 
young Russian beauty.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:11.780
Disgusting!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.520
If you want to go camping, do it by yourself.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.250
I'm going home.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.110
One hundred percent, you'll get lost.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.340
A non-standard route up the 
mountain not for beginners.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.940
You don't have a map, equipment, 
stamina, or experience.

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.990
Do you really think you can get down safely?

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.350
The sun is going to set soon, too.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.600
It's because you dragged me up here!

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:34.540
We'll head home tomorrow.

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:38.060
Let's have fun until then, the two of us.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:44.070
Now how about we get dinner ready?

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.990
Can you peel the carrots and onions?

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.450
Why do I have to?

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.430
You're the maid. You do it all.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:00.040
What?

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.590
<i>She's going to kill me if I didn't listen.</i>

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.400
This is easier than I thought.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.710
It's kind of fun.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.930
No, this is a pain!

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:16.430
All done!

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:17.950
Starting from the right...

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:23.190
I did a butter foil grill of some weird mushrooms
and fish I got while carrying you up here.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:27.280
A soup I made from some weird 
foliage I found while carrying you.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.720
And white rice.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.450
I'm not eating anything other than the rice.

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:32.290
I'm just kidding.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.360
They're all okay to eat.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.900
Really?

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.330
The vegetables you peeled...

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.460
Try dipping them in this Camembert cheese.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:42.710
<i>That looks good!</i>

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:54.660
Is it good?

00:15:55.620 --> 00:16:00.790
Is the food we made, a product of 
our love working together, good?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.940
You're way too intense.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.630
But we're having fun, right?

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:09.600
Eating the food we made outside like this...

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.950
It's not fun being with you at all.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:22.330
Milady, I'm very sorry.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:27.590
I wanted to become friends with 
you, so I did something stupid.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:35.040
I didn't think about how your innocent 
pure, pure heart could easily be hurt.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.690
The way you said that was gross.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:40.460
I'm ready to not leave this 
mountain until you forgive me!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:41.220
I forgive you!

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:43.230
Really?

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.710
I can't get home by myself, right?

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:48.980
And it's not like we're friends now.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.000
That's just fine!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:55.970
I'm going to spend time, step-by-step, 
and open the door to your heart!

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:57.990
And eventually I'll reach my goal!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:00.580
She really does word things badly...

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.010
It's nine now, so let's go to sleep.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:08.460
That's early!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.460
But we gotta get to sleep.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.460
I'm not tired yet.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:15.020
We have to get up at five tomorrow.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:15.840
That's early!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:21.820
Even just laying down and closing your 
eyes will help you get energy back.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.140
Get in.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.390
If you do anything weird, I'll bite you.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.400
I won't do anything weird.

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:35.240
I'll just record your sleeping face and what 
you sound like breathing until my cell explodes.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.910
That's what I mean by weird!

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:40.080
I'll get into the tent after 
I'm sure you've fallen asleep.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:44.410
Understood. Don't leave the area.

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:46.950
You'll end up falling and dying.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.800
I'm so bored.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:00.730
She didn't bring my phone!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.680
There isn't anything to do!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:08.810
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.930
What does everyone normally do camping?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.810
What's so fun about camping?

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:13.270
It was a little fun cooking and eating.

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:15.780
Maybe it's because she's here.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.570
If I was with friends...

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.410
If my mom was here...

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:28.220
Misha...

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:30.830
My cute little cub.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.260
I chose the name Misha from this 
cartoon bear I really loved.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:40.090
I'm going to become stardust soon.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:43.470
I'll make sure I become 
a star near Ursa Minor.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:50.020
When that happens, look for me, Misha.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:52.250
Mom...

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.480
There're so many more stars 
than I can see from my window.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.390
But...

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:02.140
I don't know where she is.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:05.650
Milady.

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:08.950
If you can't sleep, let's talk.

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:09.540
No.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:14.290
I thought this would be a perfect chance 
since you were so bored and lonely.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.880
I don't care about you at all!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.330
But it's cold out.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:20.900
It's warm inside.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.060
I'm just getting in the tent. That's all.

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.740
<i>It's warm...</i>

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:33.870
There's many different clothes 
that I think are cute.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.900
There's as many as the stars themselves.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:39.650
It's not a simple question of increasing 
the number of frills and ribbons,

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:42.360
something has to make it cuter.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.930
Bur rather it is the reduction of 
something to its absolute limit...

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.780
<i>It's really loud here, though...</i>

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.720
If I were to put what I'm 
trying to say simply,

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:55.600
a basic white one piece and a straw hat 
is the ultimate look for a young beauty.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:58.180
<i>I don't care so much, that it might 
actually help me sleep instead...</i>

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:03.050
I lost my father when I was about your age.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.310
Huh?

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:07.380
And that's when I decided
I wanted to fly through the sky.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.930
What are you talking about?

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.430
Tell me more...

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:18.130
Good morning!

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:22.050
It's a nice day today!

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.410
<i>It's morning...</i>

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.280
<i>I got a lot of sleep.</i>

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:31.040
<i>She was going on about something 
before I fell asleep, but...</i>

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:36.040
<i>It doesn't matter. It's not like I care.</i>

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:39.340
Pancake Mix

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.340
We're going to make bread from a mix today.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.840
A mix?

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.920
You can do that outside?

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:44.050
You can.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.390
We're going to wrap it on 
these sticks and bake it.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:47.700
Sticks?!

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:49.450
H-Hmph!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.710
I don't really care, though.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.980
We're going to go up to the 
observation area after we eat,

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:57.720
and we can get some of this area's
famous super-milky soft serve.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:59.730
<i>Super milky soft serve!</i>

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:03.100
Then we're going to the zoo 
at the base of the mountain.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.380
<i>Zoo!</i>

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:06.010
There's a petting area,

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:09.550
where you can pet chicks, rabbits, 
and guinea pigs as much as you want.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:11.160
<i>Chicks!</i>

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:14.600
How about we make some breakfast now?

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:20.510
Anyway, that's it for me.

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:24.170
It was fun going camping with you, Milady.

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.560
I had a terrible time with you.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:28.940
Really?

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:29.680
What do you want?

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.140
I'll see you again tomorrow.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.190
I'm home!

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:40.720
Welcome back.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:41.360
Hmm?

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.820
I brought this back for you, Yasuhiro!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:48.720
Did you know you can make bread outside?!

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.370
Chicks are really soft, too!

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:54.750
Misha, you had a lot of fun, huh?

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:57.840
Huh?

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.160
I-I didn't!

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:05.720
You idiot, Yasuhiro!

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:07.860
Misha, no biting.
